<title>ITALY: Italian retail sales rose 4.2 pct in May yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Italian retail sales rose 4.2 pct in May yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retail sales of medium and large firms in Italy rose 4.2 percent year-on-year in May, national statistics institute ISTAT said on Friday.</p>
<p>It said the retail sales index (1990=100) was 138.8 in May against 133.2 in the same 1995 month.</p>
<p>Retail sales in the first five months of 1996 rose 6.8 percent compared with the same period last year.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
